# Midnight deployment configuration.
# Copy to .env (or export these variables) before running the scripts.

# preprod | preview | undeployed
MIDNIGHT_NETWORK=preprod

# Proof server. The native or Docker proof server listens on 6300.
MIDNIGHT_PROOF_SERVER=http://127.0.0.1:6300

# Optional: reuse an existing funded wallet instead of the auto-generated one
# in .midnight-state.json.
# MIDNIGHT_WALLET_SEED=<128 hex chars>
# MIDNIGHT_WALLET_MNEMONIC=<24-word phrase>

# Optional: Preprod only. Midnight's own Preprod indexer was decommissioned on
# 2026-10-09; Blockfrost serves it now and requires a project id.
# BLOCKFROST_PROJECT_ID=nightpreprod...

# Optional: password for the local private-state store (>= 16 chars).
# PRIVATE_STATE_PASSWORD=near-midnight-bridge-development-1

# Optional: override the relayer admin secret. If unset, deploy.ts creates one
# and stores it in .bridge-secrets.json (gitignored).
# BRIDGE_ADMIN_SECRET=<64 hex chars>
